          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 23:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eki kigambo ekyabaasirwe ahali Tiro. Muchure inywe abasabara omu meli za Tarishishi, kuba Tarishishi bagiteire baginaganaga, tekiina nju anga bugobero bwa meli. N'atulikuruga Sipuro amakuru nibaija bagamanyire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 23:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muchulere inywe ab'ensi z'emyaro, muchulere inywe batuzi bekigo kya Sidoni; abo mutumire enyanja bagishabukire bangi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 23:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "babaletera engano ya Shihori n'eyezire ahali Naili; n'inywe mwatundaga omu mahanga gona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 23:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sidoni wagoka, kuba enyanja negamba eti, “Inye tinkasindikiraga anga kuzara, na mwojo na mwisiki taliho wondalezire.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 23:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orwo Misiri erahulira amakuru agagwire ahali Tiro neija kushasha muno. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 23:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mugende mugobe Tarishishi muchure inywe ab'ensi z'emyaro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 23:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eki nikyo kigo kyanyu ruranganwa ekya karai muno, ekyarugwagamu abatwazi ab'okugya kutwara amahanga? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 23:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N'ohai akozire ati ahali Tiro, ekigo kitabukwamu abakama, abatunzi abarugaga omwo mtuli bagyaga babaga batwazi, n'abatunzi bamwo bakunirwga omu mahanga? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 23:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eki kikozirwe Omukama w'amahe kushonaza abakunirwa bona omu nsi, kubachwa eikuru elyo bagizibwa ekitinwa kyabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 23:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inywe bantu ba Tarishishi, ensi yanyu mugiijure nk'omwiga gwa Naili, aha rw'okuba eky'okubatanga tikiliho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 23:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama aimukize omukono yagwolekeza omu nyanja, aho engoma zachundwa, yaragira kusilikya ebigo ebiina eboma omuli Kanaani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 23:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yashuba yagamba ati, “Iwe kigo kya Sidoni, tolibona byera rundi, enaku zakutera; shana oimuke oshabuke ogye Sipuro; kandi na yonene kulinya tolibonayo milembe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 23:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 23:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ensi y'Abakalidayo muragileba! Tekili ihanga. Abasiria bakagita yaba ishwa ly'ebikaaka. Bakabunda Tiro bakumbya eboma zayo, bagisiga amatongo bashuba bayombekamu eminara. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 23:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muchure inywe abasabara omu meli za Tarishishi, kuba ekigo kyanyu kyabaire matongo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 23:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amakiro galija orwo Tiro elyebeka emyaka nshanju, emyaka nshanju ey'omukama amara aha ngoma. Emyaka egyo nshanju orwo elihwa, Tiro elishusha omumalaya owo bazinire bati,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
